        {
          "text": "Reducing the oplog size does not immediately reclaim disk space. To free it, run compact against the oplog.rs collection in the local database during a maintenance period (the tutorial shows `use local` then `db.runCommand({ \"compact\" : \"oplog.rs\" } )`). The oplog tutorial says there are no benefits to running compact on oplog.rs after increasing the oplog size. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/replSetResizeOplog.md ; https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/tutorial/change-oplog-size.md",
